Kube Controller Manager:
There are many controllers inside the kube controller Manager and below are the list.

All these controllers are present in the kube controller manager and when you install the kube controller manager you'll get all the below controllers installed automatically.

Deployment Controller
Namespace Controller
Endpoint Controller
Job Controller
PV - Protection Controller
Service-Account-Controller
Stateful-Set
Replicaset
Node-Controller
PV-Binder-Controller
Replication Controller
CronJob
